	(text "SCHEMATIC  |  SPI host to TCAN4550  |  U.FL antenna port"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "51d6c622-12b2-4020-89bc-1d63712c0463")
	)
	(text "SCOPE / INTENT\nU201 CC2340R53E0RKPR runs the BLE application and is SPI host to the TCAN4550.\nSupplied from +3V3_SYS, so the MCU domain stays alive on battery backup while CAN is down.\nX202 48 MHz HSE uses the MCU internal load-cap array (C210/C211 DNP); X201 32.768 kHz LSE\nuses 15 pF externals. RF path is a 50 ohm microstrip to a U.FL port - see FAB_NOTES.md.\nNOTE: CC2340R53 is not AEC-Q100; see ARCHITECTURE.md assumptions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 122 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6fca52d1-02c0-4c6a-93d8-98930b7edc25")
	)
	(text "LSE Crystal"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 70.104 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "81ae4046-87bf-43ed-8bee-4f15a3d9b6b6")
	)
	(text "MCU PART NUMBER\nCC2340R53E0RKPR (512 KB, QFN-40 RKP) is the selected\norderable device in the CC2340R5 family. This MCU is not\nAEC-Q100 qualified. See the architecture and BOM notes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 136 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a33a3c4b-40aa-483c-8167-0bdd71546c43")
	)
	(text "REVIEW NOTES\nC209 = 1uF on VDDD (TI SWRA834A, section 9.1).\nX201: ABS06-32.768KHZ-9-T; CL=9pF, ESR<=90kohm, -40 to +85C.\nC212/C213: 15pF C0G, 50V, 5%; GRM1555C1H150JA01D.\nLF load: CL=C/2+Cpar; 15pF assumes Cpar=1.5pF. Verify/tune on assembled PCB.\nX202: ABM11W-48.0000MHZ-7-D1X-T3; CL=7pF, ESR<=40ohm, -40 to +85C.\nC210/C211 DNP: use internal HFXT cap array; tune in SysConfig for this PCB.\nL201 0603 footprint provisional: qualify 10uH part current/DCR against TI reference.\nC205/C208: select 10uF parts with adequate effective capacitance at bias.\nKeep the RF pi network and FLT201 compact with a continuous ground plane;\nverify the added filter and U.FL path by conducted RF testing.\nBattery telemetry (VBAT_SENSE / USING_BATTERY_N) is not connected to the MCU yet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "abb59687-9c48-4d1a-9dc8-cb3345e71505")
	)
	(text "RF Front-End & U.F.L Connector"
